{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FISH\u00b3: FIRST CATCH is the stand-alone prequel to the insane fishing adventure FISH\u00b3: FISHTASTIC FISHING FISHSCAPES.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In FIRST CATCH experience the following as you learn the origin story of FISH\u00b3: FISHTASTIC FISHING FISHSCAPES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle 3 unique levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch over 15 exotic deep sea creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of this strange ocean and meet it's weird inhabitants</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/9792e2b70799011768076c49f34c13b1.avif?t=1763042862\" width=650 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/319b8b8bc7c807f35832e96f24a5b7e4.poster.avif?t=1763042862\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/319b8b8bc7c807f35832e96f24a5b7e4.webm?t=1763042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/319b8b8bc7c807f35832e96f24a5b7e4.mp4?t=1763042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your rod to catch a powerful fish that will pull your boat, becoming a <i>fish-engine</i>, control the direction by pulling the fishing rod into desired direction and hope that the fish won't outpower you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/b5f1e06580a07e8b836bbb603927063f.avif?t=1763042862\" width=650 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/e67090715dbbfc4f8673774f2bf1f171.poster.avif?t=1763042862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/e67090715dbbfc4f8673774f2bf1f171.webm?t=1763042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/e67090715dbbfc4f8673774f2bf1f171.mp4?t=1763042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These waters are filled with a bunch of weird creatures that behave like fish. Why are they like this? What purpose do they serve? All that bothers you is that they act like fish and react to bait like fish, so that means you MUST catch them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/ab407659f1d6fe822feaf8aac6f78670.avif?t=1763042862\" width=650 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/1eff0f4d1b710f55a04c771700b5d234.poster.avif?t=1763042862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/1eff0f4d1b710f55a04c771700b5d234.webm?t=1763042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/1eff0f4d1b710f55a04c771700b5d234.mp4?t=1763042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Two hands means two fishing rods - while controlling the boat with one rod, you can cast with a second one to catch fish that tags alongside and increase your total haul.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Knight's Trusty Steed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3925720/4e2df66a27c00ea41a6dd13c81ed4d412206be5a.jpg"},{"name":"The Bright Idea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3925720/4f7a446a69807e4a24e3992f5b10f461dfdc73a6.jpg"},{"name":"FISH 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3925720/3f6c8719f6e579271c43a24878cbba1fd1cbf647.jpg"},{"name":"The World's Most Valuable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3925720/35ef23dd0f33c0b12969e349ef62138f133fce97.jpg"},{"name":"10KG Of Feathers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3925720/b3deff7d10c16c755a69a9e3f6f6ee65521de0e3.jpg"},{"name":"Outerworldy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3925720/d6f09eafc83fd84340997fabe5ea029c34b455b1.jpg"},{"name":"Catch them all!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3925720/208a102b973a4f70f4fac9d8906300879a09fa68.jpg"},{"name":"Jackpot!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3925720/6d0c22f8488b9f2e298090f9b83889630e591afd.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925720?t=1763042862","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925720?t=1763042862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/18be864b4d767d2bfe9075fce2d09ed71ef322e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763042862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/18be864b4d767d2bfe9075fce2d09ed71ef322e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763042862","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST THE FULL GAME NOW!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/ff74e60d667cd4c430000972e77099da.avif?t=1763042862\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FISH\u00b3: FIRST CATCH is the stand-alone prequel to the insane fishing adventure FISH\u00b3: FISHTASTIC FISHING FISHSCAPES.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In FIRST CATCH experience the following as you learn the origin story of FISH\u00b3: FISHTASTIC FISHING FISHSCAPES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle 3 unique levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch over 15 exotic deep sea creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of this strange ocean and meet it's weird inhabitants</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/9792e2b70799011768076c49f34c13b1.avif?t=1763042862\" width=650 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/319b8b8bc7c807f35832e96f24a5b7e4.poster.avif?t=1763042862\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/319b8b8bc7c807f35832e96f24a5b7e4.webm?t=1763042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/319b8b8bc7c807f35832e96f24a5b7e4.mp4?t=1763042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your rod to catch a powerful fish that will pull your boat, becoming a <i>fish-engine</i>, control the direction by pulling the fishing rod into desired direction and hope that the fish won't outpower you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/b5f1e06580a07e8b836bbb603927063f.avif?t=1763042862\" width=650 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/e67090715dbbfc4f8673774f2bf1f171.poster.avif?t=1763042862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/e67090715dbbfc4f8673774f2bf1f171.webm?t=1763042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/e67090715dbbfc4f8673774f2bf1f171.mp4?t=1763042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These waters are filled with a bunch of weird creatures that behave like fish. Why are they like this? What purpose do they serve? All that bothers you is that they act like fish and react to bait like fish, so that means you MUST catch them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/ab407659f1d6fe822feaf8aac6f78670.avif?t=1763042862\" width=650 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/extras/1eff0f4d1b710f55a04c771700b5d234.poster.avif?t=1763042862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925720/